  "body": "BE IN BEFORE THE SUMMER HOLIDAYS.\r\n\r\nThe instructions are clear - it's time to sell! The owner has relocated, the tenant is moving on, and an exciting opportunity has opened up in the heart of Orewa!\r\n\r\nWith summer just around the corner, now is the time to make your move. If you've been dreaming of less maintenance, more freedom and a lifestyle that feels like a permanent holiday, this could be your moment!\r\n\r\nImagine morning walks along Orewa Beach, coffee on your balcony overlooking the coastline, and cafés, restaurants and boutique shopping just moments from your door. No lawns to mow, no weekends lost to maintenance — just more time to enjoy the things you love.\r\n\r\nPositioned within the iconic Nautilus, this approximately 63m² one-bedroom plus study apartment combines coastal views, easy-care living and resort-style facilities in one fantastic central location.\r\n\r\nA LITTLE LUXURY. A LOT OF LIFESTYLE.\r\n• One bedroom plus versatile study\r\n• Approximately 63m² of easy-care living\r\n• Private balcony with wide coastal views\r\n• Two secure car parks plus storage locker\r\n• Swimming pool, spa, sauna, gym and BBQ facilities\r\n• Beach, cafés, restaurants and shops just moments away\r\n\r\nLESS MAINTENANCE. MORE FREEDOM. MORE SUMMER TO ENJOY!\r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing, looking for a weekend escape or searching for the ultimate lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, here's your chance to secure your own piece of central Orewa.\r\n\r\nTHE OWNER HAS ALREADY MADE THEIR MOVE. NOW IT'S YOUR OPPORTUNITY TO MAKE YOURS!\r\n\r\nSummer is nearly here. Why spend another one wishing you lived by the beach when you could be enjoying it?\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE FOR VIEWINGS FROM MONDAY 9TH NOVEMBER.",
